Desugar `ExprForLoop` from: `[opt_ident]: for <pat> in <head> <body>` into:
```ignore (pseudo-rust)
{
    let result = match IntoIterator::into_iter(<head>) {
        mut iter => {
            [opt_ident]: loop {
                match Iterator::next(&mut iter) {
                    None => break,
                    Some(<pat>) => <body>,
                };
            }
        }
    };
    result
}
```

